#: ../../scope.md:3
msgid ""
"Targets Postgres and Django 6.0+. Designed for a single Postgres cluster;"
" `SKIP LOCKED` already supports running multiple worker processes against"
" it in parallel."
msgstr ""
"面向 Postgres 和 Django 6.0+。设计上针对单个 Postgres 集群；`SKIP LOCKED` "
"已经支持针对该集群并行运行多个 worker 进程。"

